WEBVTT

00:07:59.526 --> 00:08:01.357
some sort of basis for handing over

00:08:01.357 --> 00:08:03.297
these users' data,

00:08:03.297 --> 00:08:05.688
we saw stories in the Washington Post last year

00:08:05.688 --> 00:08:08.900
that weren't as well reported as the PRISM story

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:11.499
that said the NSA broke in

00:08:11.499 --> 00:08:13.300
to the data center communications

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.456
between Google to itself

00:08:15.456 --> 00:08:17.034
and Yahoo to itself.

00:08:17.034 --> 00:08:19.866
So even these companies that are cooperating

00:08:19.866 --> 00:08:22.737
in at least a compelled but hopefully lawful manner

00:08:22.737 --> 00:08:24.610
with the NSA,

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:27.906
the NSA isn't satisfied with that,

00:08:27.906 --> 00:08:29.884
and because of that, we need our companies

00:08:29.884 --> 00:08:32.699
to work very hard